LAMMPS (22 Jul 2025 - Update 4)
OMP_NUM_THREADS environment is not set. Defaulting to 1 thread.
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
# =====================================================================
#  STEP 1 : Equilibrate AB (Bernal) graphite at T0 and ~0 GPa
#           ACE (ML-PACE) + D2 dispersion (tabulated), hybrid/overlay
#
#  in : graphite_ortho.data   (x = zigzag, y = armchair, z = c-axis)
#  out: graphite_eq.data      (positions + velocities -> STEP 2a / 2b)
#
#  run: mpirun -np N lmp -in in.01_equil.lammps
# =====================================================================

# ---------------- user parameters (override with -var name value) ----
variable  datafile index graphite_ortho.data
variable  T0       index 300.0        # K
variable  dt       index 0.0005       # ps (0.5 fs)
variable  tnpt     index 10.0         # ps, NPT equilibration
variable  tavg     index 10.0         # ps, NPT run used to average the cell
variable  tnvt     index 5.0          # ps, NVT at the averaged cell
variable  seed     index 4928459

# ---------------- system -------------------------------------------
units          metal
dimension      3
boundary       p p p
atom_style     charge
atom_modify    map array

read_data      ${datafile}
read_data      graphite_ortho.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (98.691643 85.46949 156.06146)
  2 by 1 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  128000 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.324 seconds

pair_style     lcbop                      # cheap stand-in for ACE+D2
pair_coeff     * * C.lcbop C
Reading potential file C.lcbop with DATE: 2012-05-22

neighbor       2.0 bin
neigh_modify   delay 0 every 1 check yes

timestep       ${dt}
timestep       0.0005

variable       nnpt equal round(${tnpt}/${dt})
variable       nnpt equal round(4/${dt})
variable       nnpt equal round(4/0.0005)
variable       navg equal 20*round(${tavg}/${dt}/20)
variable       navg equal 20*round(2/${dt}/20)
variable       navg equal 20*round(2/0.0005/20)
variable       nrep equal ${navg}/20
variable       nrep equal 4000/20
variable       nnvt equal round(${tnvt}/${dt})
variable       nnvt equal round(1/${dt})
variable       nnvt equal round(1/0.0005)

variable       Lx equal lx
variable       Ly equal ly
variable       Lz equal lz
variable       PGPa equal press/1.0e4

thermo_style   custom step time temp pe press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz density
thermo_modify  flush yes
thermo         500

# ---------------- 1a. relax cell + positions, axes independent -------
# (the supplied cell has c = 7.80 A, i.e. 3.90 A interlayer spacing;
#  ACE+D2 should pull it back to ~3.3-3.4 A)
fix            relax all box/relax aniso 0.0 vmax 0.001
minimize       0.0 1.0e-6 10000 100000
Neighbor list info ...
  update: every = 1 steps, delay = 0 steps, check = yes
  max neighbors/atom: 2000, page size: 100000
  master list distance cutoff = 8.6
  ghost atom cutoff = 8.6
  binsize = 4.3, bins = 23 20 37
  1 neighbor lists, perpetual/occasional/extra = 1 0 0
  (1) pair lcbop, perpetual
      attributes: full, newton on, ghost
      pair build: full/bin/ghost
      stencil: full/ghost/bin/3d
      bin: standard
